{"id":"ebf36f4bba071548","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-iteration.md","title":"真理迭代","display":"df-truth-iteration — 真理迭代","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-iteration","aliases":["91-df-truth-iteration","91-df-iteration"],"display":"df-truth-iteration — 真理迭代","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-iteration</span><span>91-df-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-iteration — 真理迭代"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-iteration-—-真理迭代-$T^n$\">df-truth-iteration — 真理迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (Gödel 编码)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{It}_T:\\mathbb N\\times\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{It}_T(0,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{It}_T(n+1,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\\urcorner})\n\\quad\n(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{It}_T:\\mathbb N\\times\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{It}_T(0,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{It}_T(n+1,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\\urcorner})\n\\quad\n(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\\varphi\">\\(T^n\\varphi\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\\)</span> 的缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层真理迭代</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\\varphi\">\\(T^n\\varphi\\)</span>：作为句子的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 层真理迭代；其 Gödel 编码与句子本身不可混同</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真理迭代的含义：\n真理迭代将真理谓词嵌套应用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>次。</p>\n<p>真理迭代的层次：</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层数</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^0\">\\(T^0\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></td>\n<td>原句子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^1\">\\(T^1\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n<td>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是真的&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^2\">\\(T^2\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner}) \\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner}) \\urcorner})\\)</span></td>\n<td>&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是真的&quot;是真的&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层嵌套</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层真理断言</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>真理迭代的公理（在KF+中）：\n某理论是否证明</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>取决于它是否包含相应正内省/组合真理公理，这不是递归记号本身的性质。</p>\n<p>真理迭代的性质：\n在真理原子透明的固定点评估中，对于稳定真句子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\; \\mathrm{稳定真}\\to\n\\forall n\\;(T^n\\varphi\\; \\mathrm{真})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi\\; \\mathrm{稳定真}\\to\n\\forall n\\;(T^n\\varphi\\; \\mathrm{真})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对于间隙句子：\n在透明的固定点语义中，间隙通常沿真理迭代保持；将此结论移入对象理论仍需相应公理。</p>\n<p>真理迭代的理论意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真理迭代测试理论的稳定性</li>\n<li>真理迭代展示真理的&quot;自指&quot;能力</li>\n<li>真理迭代是真理理论强度的度量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-iteration-—-真理迭代-$T^n$","text":"df-truth-iteration — 真理迭代 $T^n$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{It}_T:\\mathbb N\\times\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T},\n\\qquad\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{It}_T(0,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi,\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{It}_T(n+1,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)\\urcorner})\n\\quad\n(n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}).","display":true},{"tex":"T^n\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T^n\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T^0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T^1","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T^2","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner T(\\overline{\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner}) \\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\to\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi\\; \\mathrm{稳定真}\\to\n\\forall n\\;(T^n\\varphi\\; \\mathrm{真})","display":true}],"bytes":2298,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e7d619feee516bd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"297207ea3fca7fff","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这里的上标属于谓词符号名称；[[91-df-truth-iteration]] 中 $T^n\\varphi$\n表示同一谓词的 $n$ 次迭代，两种记号须由上下文区分。"},{"id":"b78700f82584ead6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"db63019bd413a908","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T^n\\varphi=\\operatorname{It}_T(n,\\varphi)$\n(真理迭代, see [[91-df-truth-iteration]])"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-le